@startuml EUDI_Performance_Metrics

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

title EUDI Wallet - Performance Benchmarks

salt
{
  {T
    <b>Operation</b> | <b>iOS 13+</b> | <b>Android 8.0+</b> | <b>Target</b> | <b>Status</b>
    Key Generation (ES256) | 95ms | 120ms | <150ms | <color:green>✓</color>
    Signature (ES256) | 35ms | 48ms | <50ms | <color:green>✓</color>
    Credential Store (insert) | 82ms | 95ms | <100ms | <color:green>✓</color>
    Credential Query (by type) | 15ms | 22ms | <30ms | <color:green>✓</color>
    SD-JWT Parse + Validate | 110ms | 135ms | <200ms | <color:green>✓</color>
    Key Binding JWT Creation | 45ms | 58ms | <100ms | <color:green>✓</color>
    OpenID4VCI Full Flow | 3.2s | 3.8s | <5s | <color:green>✓</color>
    OpenID4VP Full Flow | 1.1s | 1.4s | <2s | <color:green>✓</color>
    NFC DNIe Read (DG1+DG2) | 4.5s | 5.2s | <8s | <color:green>✓</color>
    MRZ Scan (Camera) | 2.1s | 2.3s | <3s | <color:green>✓</color>
  }
}

note right
  **Test Environment**
  - iOS: iPhone 12 Pro, iOS 15.6
  - Android: Pixel 5, Android 12
  - Network: WiFi 50Mbps
  - Iterations: 100 runs per operation
  - Values: median (p50)

  **Performance Factors**
  - Hardware-backed keys add ~50ms overhead
  - Network latency not included in crypto ops
  - SQLite queries use indexed lookups
  - NFC timing varies by card firmware
  - Camera MRZ depends on lighting conditions
end note

note bottom
  **Optimization Strategies**

  **Key Management**
  - Reuse KeyManager instance across app lifecycle
  - Cache public JWK to avoid repeated exports
  - Prefer Secure Enclave/StrongBox over software keys

  **Database**
  - Composite indexes for common query patterns
  - Periodic VACUUM to reclaim space
  - Limit credential metadata size

  **UI Responsiveness**
  - Async operations in background threads
  - Lazy load credential images (DG2)
  - Skeleton screens during network calls

  **Network**
  - Connection pooling for OpenID flows
  - Cache issuer metadata (TTL 24h)
  - Retry with exponential backoff
end note

@enduml
